# 2026-05-14 09:48:48.154245
+**Worktree:** /mnt/scratch/llama-upstream-wt
+**File:** common/speculative.cpp
+**File:** common/arg.cpp
+
+## Goal
+
+Wire up the `qwen3moe_assistant` Eagle MTP drafter to the speculative-decoding dispatcher and `--spec-type` CLI flag so it can be selected at server launch.
+
+The arch port (#113) and decode_mtp generalization (#114) are already landed. The only remaining inference-side scaffold is the dispatcher branch + CLI enum value.
+
+## Context
+
+In `common/speculative.cpp` there is an existing dispatcher block for `COMMON_SPECULATIVE_TYPE_GEMMA4_ASSISTANT`:
+
+```cpp
+if (params.type == COMMON_SPECULATIVE_TYPE_GEMMA4_ASSISTANT) {
+    const llama_model * model_tgt = llama_get_model(ctx_tgt);
+    if (!llama_model_has_mtp_assistant(model_tgt)) {
+        if (params.draft.mparams.path.empty()) {
+            LOG_ERR("%s: --spec-type gemma4_assistant requires --mtp-head (or --model-draft) pointing at the assistant GGUF\n", __func__);
+            ...
+        }
+        llama_model * model_tgt_mut = const_cast<llama_model *>(model_tgt);
+        llama_model_params mtp_mparams = llama_model_default_params();
+        mtp_mparams.n_gpu_layers = params.draft.n_gpu_layers > 0
+            ? params.draft.n_gpu_layers
+            : 999;
+        const int rc = llama_model_load_mtp_from_file(model_tgt_mut, params.draft.mparams.path.c_str(), mtp_mparams);
+        ...
+    }
+}
+```
+
+The state struct `common_speculative_state_gemma4_assistant` is **already arch-agnostic** (post #111 — reads via `t_h_pre_norm` tap which is wired on qwen3moe target too). So we DON'T need a separate `common_speculative_state_qwen3moe_assistant` struct. Reuse it.
+
+## Exact changes
+
+### 1. `common/speculative.h` — add enum value
+
+Find `enum common_speculative_type` (or wherever `COMMON_SPECULATIVE_TYPE_GEMMA4_ASSISTANT` is declared). Add immediately after it:
+
+```cpp
+COMMON_SPECULATIVE_TYPE_QWEN3_ASSISTANT,
+```
+
+Also find the `common_speculative_types[]` array (string ↔ enum map) in `common/speculative.cpp` and add the row `{ COMMON_SPECULATIVE_TYPE_QWEN3_ASSISTANT, "qwen3_assistant" }` next to the gemma4_assistant row. Read the file first to find exact location.
+
+### 2. `common/speculative.cpp` — extend dispatcher block
+
+In `common_speculative_init`, find the `if (params.type == COMMON_SPECULATIVE_TYPE_GEMMA4_ASSISTANT)` block (around line 1666 in current tree).
+
